","name":"Semiconductors"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"US Software"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Memory Chips"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Healthcare"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Space"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Earnings calendar FAQ"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"What US earnings are scheduled this week?"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"166 companies report this week, including Tesla(TSLA) Oct 21, 2026, Meta Platforms(META) Oct 21, 2026, Lam Research(LRCX) Oct 21, 2026, Procter & Gamble(PG) Oct 22, 2026. Dates are US Eastern Time. Add them to your calendar and get a reminder the evening before."},{"role":"StaticText","name":"When are the next big US earnings?"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Among the largest companies by market cap, the next reports are Alphabet Oct 28, 2026, Microsoft Oct 28, 2026, Apple Nov 2, 2026, NVIDIA Nov 17, 2026. Each stock page shows the days left (D-day) and the forecast EPS."},{"role":"StaticText","name":"What time zone are the earnings dates in?"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"US Eastern Time (ET). When a confirmed date is available it is shown; otherwise an estimated date derived from the company's past reporting cadence is displayed."},{"role":"StaticText","name":"What do 'pre-market' and 'after close' mean?"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Pre-market (BMO, Before Market Open) means the company reports in the morning before US markets open; after close (AMC, After Market Close) means it reports in the afternoon after the close. Timing can change how the stock reacts that day and the next."},{"role":"StaticText","name":"What should I check before an earnings report?"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"On each stock page you can see its average next-day move, how often it rose, how it reacted when it beat or missed the forecast, and whether the stock ran up before the report. That helps you spot stocks that fall even on good results."},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Can I add earnings dates to my own calendar?"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Yes. Subscribe to the earnings calendar and your stocks' report dates land in Google or Apple Calendar automatically, with a reminder the night before. No login needed, and you can bundle multiple stocks like Big Tech or semis in one subscription. See the earnings calendar subscription guide for details."},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Can a scheduled date change?"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Yes. Before a company confirms its date, we show an estimate based on past reporting cycles, marked with a dashed border on the calendar. When the company confirms or moves the date, we update it automatically, and any calendar you subscribed to updates with it."},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Is the calendar free? Do I need an account?"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"It's free. Without logging in you can pick one preset such as Big Tech or Semiconductors and subscribe right away. Logging in lets you combine presets and add up to 50 tickers by search."},{"role":"StaticText","name":"When do reminders arrive?"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"The evening before each earnings date. It uses the built-in reminders in Google or Apple Calendar, so there's no extra app to install."},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Which companies appear on the calendar?"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"About 1,200 major US-listed companies including the S&P 500. Every company reporting that day is listed, and widely discussed names are marked with a star."},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Do companies report earnings on US market holidays?"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Almost never. Days the US market is closed are marked \"Closed\" on the calendar, and days it shuts at 1:00 p.m. ET are marked \"Early close.\" The NYSE observes ten holidays: New Year's Day, Martin Luther King, Jr. Day, Washington's Birthday, Good Friday, Memorial Day, Juneteenth, Independence Day, Labor Day, Thanksgiving Day and Christmas Day."},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Which days does the US market close early?"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Usually the day after Thanksgiving and Christmas Eve, when trading ends at 1:00 p.m. ET instead of 4:00 p.m. When Independence Day falls on a Tuesday, July 3 closes early as well. Volume is thin on these half days and earnings are rarely scheduled."},{"role":"StaticText","name":"US earnings, the easiest place to see"},{"role":"link","name":"Major stocks","states":[{"name":"focusable","value":true}]},{"role":"link","name":"Calendar","states":[{"name":"focusable","value":true}]},{"role":"link","name":"Guide","states":[{"name":"focusable","value":true}]},{"role":"link","name":"About","states":[{"name":"focusable","value":true}]},{"role":"link","name":"Privacy","states":[{"name":"focusable","value":true}]},{"role":"link","name":"Terms","states":[{"name":"focusable","value":true}]},{"role":"link","name":"Feedback","states":[{"name":"focusable","value":true}]},{"role":"link","name":"Home","states":[{"name":"focusable","value":true}]},{"role":"link","name":"Earnings (new)","states":[{"name":"focusable","value":true}]},{"role":"link","name":"Upcoming","states":[{"name":"focusable","value":true}]},{"role":"button","name":"Feedback","states":[{"name":"focusable","value":true},{"name":"invalid","value":"false"}]},{"role":"StaticText","name":"CALENDAR"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"US stock earnings dates,\n"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"all in one view"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Never miss an earnings date or time for major US companies like NVIDIA, Tesla and Apple."},{"role":"StaticText","name":"D-"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Oct 16"},{"role":"StaticText","name":" ("},{"role":"StaticText","name":")"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Truist Financial Corporation"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"M&T Bank Corporation"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Citizens Financial Group Inc."},{"role":"StaticText","name":"Regions Financial Corporation"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"BA"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"BancFirst Corporation"},{"role":"StaticText","name":"HD"},{"role":"Static